athe life back into every corner of this floating oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the varied landscapes of Heimsskjald's back, from hidden caves to sun-drenched meadows. Discover creatures both brave and timid, meet mystical mermaids in the turtle's wake, and uncover remnants of a forgotten era. Every nook and cranny of the shell holds a secret waiting for a curious spirit to find it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Ancient Magic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relearn the forgotten arts of the Leshen. Iona\u2019s magic isn't just for show, it\u2019s a tool for transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/05c3b029494b0d956d70724a4ed23cca.webp?t=1772234741\" width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.poster.avif?t=1772234741\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.webm?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/7562103563539883018523b082b4a156.mp4?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Land</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mind\u2019s eye to grow, shrink, and mold the environment to your liking. Cleanse the disarray and watch as color and vibrancy return to the soil in real-time. Combine nature elements to create unique compositions. Go beyond the roots of the island and touch the stars themselves. In this cozy sandbox adventure, your creativity doesn't just make the island beautiful \u2014 it restores global balance, turning a desolate shell into a dazzling sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield the Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock mysteries that allow you to influence the very flora and stones that call the turtle home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/b2c8a7f8ebee01713b73c1661a6c7c14.avif?t=1772234741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras_big/b2c8a7f8ebee01713b73c1661a6c7c14.avif?t=1772234741 width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.poster.avif?t=1772234741\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.webm?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/dbaf2684f67bf020cb045d250d1aefab.mp4?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend a Fantastical Cast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't alone on this journey! Meet a community of whimsical beings, each with their own stories, quirks, and quests that only a Leshen can solve. As you restore their homes, you\u2019ll earn their gratitude and hear the stories of the world during your Great Slumber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/17dc7be3b16e7ab497534dbef5dd303c.avif?t=1772234741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras_big/17dc7be3b16e7ab497534dbef5dd303c.avif?t=1772234741 width=800 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.poster.avif?t=1772234741\" width=720 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.webm?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/extras/298096704c5944af82184c4b66a2245a.mp4?t=1772234741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the soothing, relaxing songs and sounds of nature, sit down by the river and stay a while listening to its music. The varied environment allows you to dive into many of your favorite retreats. Unwind with the natural symphony or give in to the music and do a little dance!</p>","developers":["Cozyflame Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3674070/a440e9dfe6b1177cb0876e83bf8d86f5d747228b/header.jpg?t=1772234741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3674070/871058/f52de8e6aa75674a012bfde20b88535f21f2136f/1750397772/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749496772","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3674070/871058/f52de8e6aa756