wn enchanting sandbox style sanctuary. Uncover secrets and reshape the world accompanied by cozy, lofi vibes.","steam_appid":3674070,"support_info":{"email":"cozyflamegames@gmail.com","url":"http://cozyflamegames.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.cozyflamegames.com/"}